{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "保", "id": "保"}, {"form": "信", "variants": [], "id": "信"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "憂", "id": "憂"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "里", "id": "里"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.9236708391717776, "source": "天", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 3.0155349008501706, "source": "天", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 3.120895416507997, "source": "天", "target": "保"}, {"weight": 1.128465251817791, "source": "天", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 0.09237332013101507, "source": "天", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.0743754008731043, "source": "安", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 3.6805112044434196, "source": "安", "target": "怒"}, {"weight": 2.0382834691863283, "source": "安", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.2141741356499924, "source": "政", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.0710732920093196, "source": "政", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 1.2826159316450492, "source": "政", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.6010696627635836, "source": "政", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.7346010553881064, "source": "政", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 1.7833912195575383, "source": "聞", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 0.7717903078790584, "source": "聞", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.916922612182061, "source": "聞", "target": "里"}, {"weight": 1.5602476682433286, "source": "聞", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 0.790139446547255, "source": "樂", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 0.